  "post_content": "<p>El CD Onda &quot;B&quot; ha goleado tambi&eacute;n esta tarde al Almenara &quot;B&quot; por 3-0, en un partido disputado desde las 18 horas en el campo municipal L&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic de 2&ordf; categor&iacute;a regional de f&uacute;tbol, cuyo grupo 3&ordm; encabeza.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_0268.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La primera parte ha finalizado con el resultado de 1-0, gracias a un gol de Xuti, que ha aprovechado el claro dominio local. En la segunda mitad ha vuelto a marcar Xuti, pero esta vez de penalti. Miguel ha establecido el 3-0 final, que ha machacado al Almenara &quot;B&quot;, que apenas ha tenido dos ocasiones.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0268.jpg\" alt=\"img_0268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0270.jpg\" alt=\"img_0270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0271.jpg\" alt=\"img_0271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0272.jpg\" alt=\"img_0272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0273.jpg\" alt=\"img_0273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0274.jpg\" alt=\"img_0274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0275.jpg\" alt=\"img_0275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0276.jpg\" alt=\"img_0276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0277.jpg\" alt=\"img_0277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0278.jpg\" alt=\"img_0278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0279.jpg\" alt=\"img_0279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0280.jpg\" alt=\"img_0280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0281.jpg\" alt=\"img_0281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cdondab-almenarafb-b/img_0282.jpg\" alt=\"img_0282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
